# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn the noise model of a gate for the latest version of Qiskit noise learning"
msgstr "Alamin ang noise model ng isang gate para sa pinakabagong bersyon ng Qiskit noise learning"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn the noise model of a gate"
msgstr "Alamin ang noise model ng isang gate"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn the noise model of a gate {#learn-the-noise-model-of-a-gate}"
msgstr "Alamin ang noise model ng isang gate {#learn-the-noise-model-of-a-gate}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This tutorial demonstrates learning a noise model for a unitary gate with a standard learning protocol accessible through the high-level protocol functions [`prepare_vanilla_program()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-prepare-vanilla-program#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program\") and [`process_vanilla_result()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-process-vanilla-result#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result\").\n"
msgstr "Ipinapakita ng tutorial na ito ang pag-aaral ng noise model para sa isang unitary gate gamit ang standard na learning protocol na naaabot sa pamamagitan ng mga high-level protocol function na [`prepare_vanilla_program()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-prepare-vanilla-program#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program\") at [`process_vanilla_result()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-process-vanilla-result#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result\").\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define the gate\n"
msgstr "I-define ang gate\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up local simulation\n"
msgstr "I-set up ang lokal na simulation\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '3.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the quantum program\n"
msgstr "Ihanda ang quantum program\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '4.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the quantum program\n"
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang quantum program\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '5.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Read the results\n"
msgstr "Basahin ang mga resulta\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Running on real hardware\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  The circuits below are simulated locally, so this walkthrough needs no IBM Quantum® credentials. To alternatively run it on a real device:\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Pagpapatakbo sa totoong hardware\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  Ang mga circuit sa ibaba ay sinisimulate nang lokal, kaya hindi kailangan ng walkthrough na ito ng mga IBM Quantum® credential. Para patakbuhin ito sa totoong device:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '  *   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1**: replace [`FakeMarrakesh`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/fake-provider-fake-marrakesh \"(in Qiskit Runtime IBM Client)\") with a real backend.\n"
msgstr "**Hakbang 1**: palitan ang [`FakeMarrakesh`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/fake-provider-fake-marrakesh \"(in Qiskit Runtime IBM Client)\") ng totoong backend.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  *   **Step 2**: pass that backend as the executor’s mode, and drop the simulator options.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"  *   **Hakbang 2**: ipasa ang backend na iyon bilang mode ng executor, at alisin ang mga simulator option.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"define-the-gate\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Define the gate {#1-define-the-gate}"
msgstr "1. I-define ang gate {#1-define-the-gate}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The gate is a [`BoxOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.BoxOp) holding a twirled layer of six disjoint `CZ` gates.\n"
msgstr "Ang gate ay isang [`BoxOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.BoxOp) na may hawak na twirled layer ng anim na disjoint na `CZ` gate.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Running on real hardware\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Pagpapatakbo sa totoong hardware\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"set-up-local-simulation\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Set up local simulation {#2-set-up-local-simulation}"
msgstr "2. I-set up ang lokal na simulation {#2-set-up-local-simulation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Pauli indices inside each map are local to the gate, in ascending physical-qubit order:\n"
msgstr "Ang mga Pauli index sa loob ng bawat map ay lokal sa gate, sa pataas na pagkakasunod-sunod ng pisikal na qubit:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define the noise with a correlated `ZZ` term and a weaker `XX` term on each `CZ` pair, plus a single-qubit `Z` term everywhere; measurement gets a bit-flip term per qubit.\n"
msgstr "Tukuyin ang noise gamit ang correlated na `ZZ` term at mas mahinang `XX` term sa bawat `CZ` pair, kasama ang isang single-qubit na `Z` term sa lahat ng dako; ang measurement ay may bit-flip term bawat qubit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a box for measurement to learn.\n"
msgstr "Gumawa ng box para matutunan ng measurement.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each entry of `layer_noise_model` pairs one of those boxes with the map to apply to it. Use the stabilizer simulation method, and set `seed_simulator` to make the simulated data reproducible.\n"
msgstr "Ang bawat entry ng `layer_noise_model` ay nagpapares ng isa sa mga box na iyon sa map na ia-apply dito. Gamitin ang stabilizer simulation method, at itakda ang `seed_simulator` para maging reproducible ang simulated na data.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"prepare-the-quantum-program\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Prepare the quantum program {#3-prepare-the-quantum-program}"
msgstr "3. Ihanda ang quantum program {#3-prepare-the-quantum-program}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use [`prepare_vanilla_program()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-prepare-vanilla-program#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program\") to build the quantum program containing the learning experiments.\n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang [`prepare_vanilla_program()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-prepare-vanilla-program#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program\") para buuin ang quantum program na naglalaman ng mga learning experiment.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"run-the-quantum-program\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Run the quantum program {#4-run-the-quantum-program}"
msgstr "4. Patakbuhin ang quantum program {#4-run-the-quantum-program}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Submit the quantum program. This step is the same whether the executor is pointed at a simulator or at a real device.\n"
msgstr "Isumite ang quantum program. Pareho ang hakbang na ito kahit ang executor ay nakaturo sa simulator o sa totoong device.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"read-the-results\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "5. Read the results {#5-read-the-results}"
msgstr "5. Basahin ang mga resulta {#5-read-the-results}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Process the result with [`process_vanilla_result()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-process-vanilla-result#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result\").\n"
msgstr "Iproseso ang resulta gamit ang [`process_vanilla_result()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-process-vanilla-result#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result\").\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plot per-qubit-pair fidelity decays: both the data and the exponential fit.\n"
msgstr "I-plot ang fidelity decay ng bawat qubit pair: parehong ang data at ang exponential fit.\n"
